.eclass-token
# your courses: OUC course materials, your submissions, grades, notes, updates
semesters/*
!semesters/README.md
# your study memory and personal instructions for Claude
memory/
STUDENT.md
CLAUDE.local.md
# local state: installer reports, installed copies of ai/ and dev/skills/
.ouc/
.claude/*
.agents/
