!.claude/settings.json
# generated opencode agents and your local model choice (opencode.json in the root is shared)
.opencode/

# Superpowers' design specs and plans stay local (summarise them in the PR)
docs/superpowers/

# session handover notes (mention personal details)
HANDOVER.md

# visuals an AI saved outside semesters/ (the app asks for semesters/<id>/visuals/)
visualizations/

